- 输入：`role="combobox" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="palette-listbox" aria-activedescendant="palette-item-{id}" aria-autocomplete="list"`
- 列表：`id="palette-listbox" role="listbox"`，选项 `role="option" aria-selected="index === activeIndex" id="palette-item-{id}"`
- 遮罩点击关闭
